            <ArticleTitle>Pathologic features of sudden cardiac death: an overview.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>487-93</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sudden cardiac death is a frequent initial manifestation of underlying heart disease. We review the most frequent pathologic cardiovascular findings in victims of sudden cardiac death. We also discuss the role of exercise as a precipitant of sudden cardiac death.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
